{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just lost your job and you're ready to live a little before getting back to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third game to the &quot;Bad Dog&quot; Series you'll embark, no pun intended, on a fun adventure for the next few weeks in-between jobs. Go out on dinner dates, meet new friends, and make love  in this new feature packed adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different locations, ask Banjo out on different excursions and explore new mini-games in this addition to the series. You have access to the world in your hands.... uhhh, urrrr.. paws! With that you get to make decisions on what you'd like to do for the day, sure lounging around is fun and all but you could also get laid while you're at it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This jam-packed adventure is story oriented and takes place over the course of approx. 14 levels/days which each have their unique opportunities for adventures with Banjo and others. The primary game-play is point and click, however there are mini-games throughout different areas which may differ into different game styles such as retro game-play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your time off work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018110?t=1759109011","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018110?t=1759109011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018110/d532d1ac68388a2b3af0b68d100bc7a63651c2a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759109011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018110/d532d1ac68388a2b3af0b68d100bc7a63651c2a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759109011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Generally the entire game's premise is about partying and sleeping with guys. Having a good general FWB atmosphere with consent amongst anthropomorphic friends."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just lost your job and you're ready to live a little before getting back to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third game to the &quot;Bad Dog&quot; Series you'll embark, no pun intended, on a fun adventure for the next few weeks in-between jobs. Go out on dinner dates, meet new friends, and make love  in this new feature packed adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different locations, ask Banjo out on different excursions and explore new mini-games in this addition to the series. You have access to the world in your hands.... uhhh, urrrr.. paws! With that you get to make decisions on what you'd like to do for the day, sure lounging around is fun and all but you could also get laid while you're at it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This jam-packed adventure is story oriented and takes place over the course of approx. 14 levels/days which each have their unique opportunities for adventures with Banjo and others. The primary game-play is point and click, however there are mini-games throughout different areas which may differ into different game styles such as retro game-play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your time off work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bad Dog Banjo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018110/1d9e5cffddf15634994184423a46950d060d0bf3/header.jpg?t=1759109011","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 7700k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li>